From cd9bbd93b6e402d20f6e3f3a8f330811b9e02e8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sora Su <baxiche@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Jul 2025 14:06:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] oem-meta: Add file IO responder for event logs from BIC

Add handler for write-file command "EVENT_LOG", which is sent
when host events are triggered, parse event type from a list and
add SEL in BMC.

Tested: Verified in yosemite4 platform. All event are recorded
correctly.

